{
  "created_at": "2026-10-24T15:29:11.099790+00:00",
  "created_by": "ARGUS demo authors",
  "demo": {
    "description": "A medium-sized electron linac laboratory: accelerator, civil and building, administration, radiation safety areas, IT and controls, electrical, HVAC, vacuum, optics and plant, with a site map, floor plans, a beam model from the gun to the dumps bound to its physical units, motors and actuators, PBS codes, work packages and modules, the service utilities each consumer needs, documents, issues and activities.",
    "notice": "Synthetic demo: the Valmora Linac Laboratory, its machine, people, suppliers, figures and procedures are fictional. Nothing here is operating, safety or radiation-protection guidance.",
    "organisation": "Valmora Linac Laboratory (fictional)",
    "steps": [
      {
        "link": "/map",
        "text": "The Accelerator Building, Utilities Building and Administration Building, the radiation areas, the cooling water main, the power feeder and the controls fibre. Choose the Accelerator Building's ground floor to see the machine layout.",
        "title": "Start on the site map"
      },
      {
        "link": "/assets/vl-bld-acc",
        "text": "Its floor, rooms and plan: linac bunker, klystron gallery, laser room, control room and service areas.",
        "title": "The Accelerator Building"
      },
      {
        "link": "/assets/vl-room-bunker",
        "text": "The controlled area with the beamline: each physical unit is placed on the plan at its beam position.",
        "title": "Inside the bunker"
      },
      {
        "link": "/beam-model",
        "text": "Injector → four accelerating sections → diagnostics → main dump, with the spectrometer branch. Positions are along the beam (s, from the gun), apart from the map.",
        "title": "The machine along the beam"
      },
      {
        "link": "/assets/vl-unit-acc02",
        "text": "AS-2: its beam position, the klystron and waveguide that feed it, the cooling loop, its supplier contract.",
        "title": "One accelerating structure"
      },
      {
        "link": "/assets/vl-ur-acc02",
        "text": "AS-2's utility requirement: cooling water flow, temperature stability, the loop and the control valve that serve it. The summary lists every consumer.",
        "title": "What a structure needs from the services"
      },
      {
        "link": "/documents/vl-doc-motion",
        "text": "Screen insertion axes, the spectrometer slit and the laser mirror on motion controller MC-1; pneumatic actuators on the Faraday cup and sector valves.",
        "title": "Motors and actuators"
      },
      {
        "link": "/assets/vl-kly-2",
        "text": "Klystron K-2: modulator, low-level RF, timing, the interlock that acts on the modulator, its spare on order.",
        "title": "Follow the RF chain"
      },
      {
        "link": "/tickets/vl-t-003",
        "text": "Modulator M-2 trips after a restart, linked to the spare klystron request and to the logbook.",
        "title": "An open issue"
      },
      {
        "link": "/activities",
        "text": "The winter shutdown, the alignment survey, weekly vacuum checks and the periodic interlock test.",
        "title": "Planned work"
      },
      {
        "link": "/documents/vl-doc-spec",
        "text": "The machine's sections and design positions, with the layout drawing.",
        "title": "Read the specification"
      }
    ],
    "synthetic": true,
    "title": "Medium Linac Facility"
  },
